4. Xiaomi Mi protocol research
-----------------------------

   Research: CamiAlfa's M365-BLE-PROTOCOL
   Source:   https://github.com/CamiAlfa/M365-BLE-PROTOCOL
   Reference behavior: the owner's M365-Rokid-HUD Android app and
                       ninebot-ble Rust examples (read-only inspection)

RideFlux's Xiaomi Mi implementation is independently written Kotlin using
documented behavior, JCA primitives and independent fixed-input Python test
vectors. No Rust source was copied. The inspected Rust README claims MIT and
credits the research above, but its manifest refers to a LICENSE.md that is
missing from the inspected directory. That licensing question remains open;
this notice does not claim a license for missing third-party material.
